00:00:00,001 --> 00:00:11,154
The gun has played a critical role in history, an invention which has been praised and denounced, served hero and villain alike, and carries with it moral

2
00:00:11,155 --> 00:00:12,240
responsibility.

3
00:00:13,120 --> 00:00:16,320
To understand the gun is to better understand history.

4
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,920
They are the guardians of civilized society.

5
00:00:24,921 --> 00:00:30,920
They represent a thin blue line protecting ordinary citizens from hardened criminals.

6
00:00:30,921 --> 00:00:36,920
For more than 150 years, police officers across America have employed a vast array of weapons

7
00:00:36,921 --> 00:00:40,920
in an endless fight to maintain law and order.

8
00:00:40,921 --> 00:00:43,920
Now, police guns on Modern Marvels.

9
00:00:54,920 --> 00:01:07,800
Any given day, we'll find almost 700,000 police officers patrolling America's streets.

10
00:01:09,280 --> 00:01:12,420
Though they've become a constant presence in our lives,

11
00:01:12,920 --> 00:01:16,620
organized police departments are, in fact, a relatively new development.

12
00:01:19,020 --> 00:01:24,820
Prior to the mid-19th century, most cities employed constables and watchmen to help keep the peace.

13
00:01:24,920 --> 00:01:30,920
Constables dated from the Middle Ages and were generally unarmed.

14
00:01:30,921 --> 00:01:36,920
As a rule, they intervened in crimes only when there was the potential to earn a good fee.

15
00:01:36,921 --> 00:01:41,920
But as the urban population in the eastern United States swelled,

16
00:01:41,921 --> 00:01:45,920
there was a growing need for better ways to deter crime.

17
00:01:45,921 --> 00:01:52,920
For solutions, many cities looked across the Atlantic to London's Metropolitan Police.

18
00:01:52,921 --> 00:01:59,920
Founded in 1829, this was the first modern and professional police department in the world.

19
00:01:59,921 --> 00:02:06,920
They organized along military lines and wore distinctive uniforms.

20
00:02:06,921 --> 00:02:12,920
The creation of the force was championed by statesman Sir Robert Bobby Peel,

21
00:02:12,921 --> 00:02:15,920
hence the familiar nickname, Bobbies.

22
00:02:15,921 --> 00:02:23,960
Contrary to popular belief, some of these first patrolmen were allowed to carry weapons

23
00:02:23,961 --> 00:02:27,460
They were given revolvers

24
00:02:27,461 --> 00:02:31,320
One of the most famous would be the Webley Metropolitan Police

25
00:02:31,321 --> 00:02:34,380
It was actually used by the forces

26
00:02:34,381 --> 00:02:38,500
It was a reliable, powerful, robust little pistol

27
00:02:38,501 --> 00:02:41,740
You would not feel an arm carrying one of these today

28
00:02:41,741 --> 00:02:45,820
As you can see, it had a short barrel, a fairly small butt

29
00:02:45,821 --> 00:02:48,600
double action, it was easy to be concealed,

30
00:02:49,060 --> 00:02:51,260
and a very, very effective little revolver.

31
00:02:51,340 --> 00:02:52,760
As a matter of fact, there's some supposition

32
00:02:52,761 --> 00:02:54,560
that this would be the very revolver

33
00:02:54,561 --> 00:02:56,220
that was carried by Sherlock Holmes.

34
00:02:57,840 --> 00:03:01,080
In 1845, New York City established

35
00:03:01,081 --> 00:03:04,040
the first modern police department in the United States.

36
00:03:07,500 --> 00:03:10,240
Known as the New York Municipal Police Force,

37
00:03:10,540 --> 00:03:12,980
it copied London's organizational structure

38
00:03:12,981 --> 00:03:14,660
and imitated their uniforms.

39
00:03:15,820 --> 00:03:20,920
but city officials added their own finishing touch.

40
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:25,700
They did agree to wear an eight-pointed copper star

41
00:03:25,701 --> 00:03:27,840
with the seal of the city at the center.

42
00:03:28,860 --> 00:03:31,580
They, of course, immediately shined that star up

43
00:03:31,581 --> 00:03:32,900
and began patrolling with it.

44
00:03:32,901 --> 00:03:36,000
They were known in the press as the new star police,

45
00:03:36,220 --> 00:03:39,720
but they were known popularly on the streets as coppers,

46
00:03:39,920 --> 00:03:42,100
which later was, of course, shortened to cops.

47
00:03:43,580 --> 00:03:45,760
New York was just the start,

48
00:03:45,820 --> 00:03:49,820
Before long, cities all over the country had followed suit.

49
00:03:49,821 --> 00:03:55,820
At first, all of these new police departments were officially unarmed.

50
00:03:55,821 --> 00:03:59,820
Because of the political climate of the times,

51
00:03:59,821 --> 00:04:04,820
many feared that an armed police force might be viewed as an army of occupation.

52
00:04:06,820 --> 00:04:11,820
But politics aside, an officer of the law encountered many dangerous situations.

53
00:04:11,821 --> 00:04:18,120
And a personally purchased firearm was sometimes the only means of defense.

54
00:04:20,020 --> 00:04:26,200
This single-shot Allen percussion pistol belonged to a Baltimore City police officer in the 1850s.

55
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:33,360
This would have been probably the most inexpensive handgun that could be bought at the time.

56
00:04:33,780 --> 00:04:37,820
It only gave you one shot. It's a muzzleloader, percussion cap ignition.

57
00:04:38,280 --> 00:04:39,760
They were cheaper, easier to get,

58
00:04:40,320 --> 00:04:43,520
and the men were only being paid about $1 or $2 a day.

59
00:04:43,920 --> 00:04:46,760
So this was something that was very popular, very concealable.

60
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:49,580
They could put it in their pants pocket, in their coat pocket,

61
00:04:49,840 --> 00:04:50,600
stick it in their belt,

62
00:04:50,860 --> 00:04:53,160
but still be accessible when they would need it.

63
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:55,900
The problem being they only had one shot.

64
00:04:56,820 --> 00:04:59,660
And if they were really into some problems on the street,

65
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:02,580
they only had that one shot, so they had to make that count.

66
00:05:02,581 --> 00:05:11,780
In 1857, the Baltimore Police Department became the first in the country to officially adopt a standardized weapon.

67
00:05:13,420 --> 00:05:17,400
The city of Baltimore purchased one of these for each one of their police officers

68
00:05:17,401 --> 00:05:20,800
