69
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:27,400
The Colt 1849 pocket models were .31 caliber percussion revolvers.

70
00:05:27,660 --> 00:05:31,520
They were issued after an officer was nearly killed by a mob.

71
00:05:32,580 --> 00:05:39,120
The citizenry felt that they should have their officers better protected.

72
00:05:39,121 --> 00:05:44,480
This could be reloaded quicker and is a much more reliable handgun and probably even more

73
00:05:44,481 --> 00:05:45,480
accurate.

74
00:05:45,481 --> 00:05:51,960
The threat of mob violence, coupled with a rising crime rate, would eventually force

75
